Package: altdown
Title: A 'pkgdown'-Style Theme for 'altdoc' Websites
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Date: 2026-08-27
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Bjarke", family = "Hautop Kristensen", email = "bjarke.hautop@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a theme and helper functions for building package
    websites with 'altdoc' and 'Quarto', styled to resemble 'pkgdown'.
    Because the site is rendered by 'Quarto', all 'Quarto' features are
    supported.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://bjarkehautop.github.io/altdown/, https://github.com/bjarkehautop/altdown
BugReports: https://github.com/bjarkehautop/altdown/issues
SystemRequirements: Quarto command line tool
    (<https://github.com/quarto-dev/quarto-cli>).
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports:
    altdoc,
    cli,
    desc,
    fs,
    tools,
    utils,
    yaml
Suggests:
    httr2,
    quarto,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
